		{
			dependencies: ["729E3A063736105A"]
			description: [
				"&7Hadalite, a material swirling with darkness and abyssal vibrations."
				""
				"&7Your initial chemical analysis has revealed extremely value materials such as Holmium and Thallium.&r"
				""
				"&7You should dig deeper and unlock the true nature of this ore, you might be nearing a breakthrough.&r"
				""
				"Welcome to Superchain #2, this chain itself will represent a achievement similar to when you constructed your first Platinum metallic Products. "
				""
				"You'll be extracting, fusing, fissioning, and processing your way to several new materials all overlapping eachother in their own ways"
				""
				"Firstly, &eThallium&r, followed by &eHolmium&r and &eGermanium&r, then pushing your way into exotic materials like &eSeaborgium&r, &eTaranium&r, and the fabled living flame, &cIgniclad&r."
				""
				"You'll also need to process down Naummunite into &e&lRubidium&r for a unique &6glass supercoolant&r."
			]
